  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 4 NGO Lviv Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses the lack of transparency and accountability in government institutions by uncovering and exposing corruption, inefficiencies, and potential misuse of financial resources through in-depth investigative journalism. By focusing on procurement, financial aid distribution, and public officials&#x2019; declarations, the project seeks to provide evidence-based insights that inform public discourse, empower civil society, and strengthen institutional integrity. Additionally, by advocating for the findings through partnerships with civil society organizations and law enforcement agencies, the project contributes to policy improvements and enforcement actions against corruption.</narrative>
  </description>
